---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="NESDZ — ULM, aviation légère, météo & terrains"
  description="NESDZ, média et outil pilote autour de l’ULM et de l’aviation légère : journal, modèles, annuaire ULM et météo & terrains."
>
  <section class="container home-page home-hero-section">
    <div class="home-hero card">
      <div class="home-hero-grid">
        <div class="home-hero-copy">
          <div class="home-kicker">ULM · Aviation légère · Outil pilote</div>
          <h1>NESDZ, le journal et l’outil terrain pour les pilotes.</h1>
          <p class="home-lead">
            Un site éditorial premium pensé pour l’aviation légère, avec un accès
            immédiat à la météo aviation, aux terrains, aux radios utiles et aux
            repères proches.
          </p>

          <div class="home-hero-actions">
            <a class="cta-tool" href="/outils/">
              <span class="cta-tool__eyebrow">Outil phare</span>
              <span class="cta-tool__label">Météo &amp; terrains</span>
              <span class="cta-tool__meta">METAR · TAF · radios · terrains proches</span>
            </a>

            <div class="home-secondary-actions">
              <a class="secondary-link" href="/journal/">Voir le journal</a>
              <a class="secondary-link" href="/annuaire-ulm/">Explorer l’annuaire ULM</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="home-hero-panel">
          <div class="hero-panel-card">
            <span class="hero-panel-badge">Accès rapide</span>
            <h2>L’outil pilote NESDZ</h2>
            <ul class="hero-panel-list">
              <li>Lecture rapide METAR / TAF</li>
              <li>Terrain demandé et terrain météo voisin si nécessaire</li>
              <li>Fréquences radio utiles</li>
              <li>Aérodromes proches et plateformes ULM distinctes</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="hero-panel-link" href="/outils/?icao=LFQQ">Essayer avec LFQQ</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-page">
    <div class="home-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">À la une</p>
        <h2>Les grands accès NESDZ</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-grid home-grid--four">
      <a class="home-card home-card--tool" href="/outils/">
        <span class="home-card-kicker">Outil pilote</span>
        <h3>Météo &amp; terrains</h3>
        <p>
          L’accès le plus utile du site pour préparer un vol, vérifier un terrain
          et lire rapidement la météo aviation.
        </p>
        <span class="home-card-link">Ouvrir l’outil</span>
      </a>

      <a class="home-card" href="/journal/">
        <span class="home-card-kicker">Édito &amp; actualité</span>
        <h3>Derniers articles</h3>
        <p>
          Retrouver la ligne éditoriale NESDZ, les publications récentes et les
          sujets aviation légère mis en avant.
        </p>
        <span class="home-card-link">Voir le journal</span>
      </a>

      <a class="home-card" href="/modeles/">
        <span class="home-card-kicker">Machines &amp; culture ULM</span>
        <h3>Modèles en vedette</h3>
        <p>
          Une entrée claire pour parcourir les modèles, comparer les profils et
          garder une lecture propre du catalogue NESDZ.
        </p>
        <span class="home-card-link">Voir les modèles</span>
      </a>

      <a class="home-card" href="/annuaire-ulm/">
        <span class="home-card-kicker">France ULM</span>
        <h3>Annuaire ULM</h3>
        <p>
          Explorer les plateformes, retrouver les bases et croiser la lecture
          terrain avec l’écosystème ULM français.
        </p>
        <span class="home-card-link">Ouvrir l’annuaire</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-page home-highlight-section">
    <div class="home-highlight card">
      <div class="home-highlight-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Produit</p>
          <h2>Un site éditorial qui devient un vrai outil pilote.</h2>
          <p class="home-highlight-text">
            NESDZ n’est pas une simple vitrine. La direction est claire : garder
            une identité premium, sobre et crédible, tout en construisant un
            outil vraiment utile pour les pilotes ULM et l’aviation légère.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-highlight-points">
          <div class="highlight-point">
            <strong>Météo claire</strong>
            <span>METAR, TAF, lecture rapide et repères voisins quand un terrain ne publie pas.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-point">
            <strong>Terrains utiles</strong>
            <span>Aérodromes, plateformes ULM, bases France et proximité lisible.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-point">
            <strong>Radio exploitable</strong>
            <span>Lecture briefing, fréquences utiles et montée en qualité progressive.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    .home-page {
      padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .home-hero-section {
      padding-top: 28px;
    }

    .home-hero,
    .home-highlight {
      padding: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.12), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.028), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.016)),
        rgba(11, 18, 27, 0.92);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
        0 24px 56px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
    }

    .home-hero-grid,
    .home-highlight-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(300px, 0.95fr);
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 34px;
    }

    .home-kicker,
    .section-kicker,
    .home-card-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(191, 214, 228, 0.8);
    }

    .home-hero-copy h1 {
      margin: 12px 0 14px;
      font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 6vw, 5.2rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .home-lead,
    .home-highlight-text {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.72;
      color: rgba(220, 230, 238, 0.84);
    }

    .home-hero-actions {
      margin-top: 28px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .cta-tool {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #f8fcff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(126, 203, 240, 0.64);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(183, 229, 255, 0.14), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.42), rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.2)),
        rgba(22, 40, 54, 0.98);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.1),
        0 18px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      transition:
        transform 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease,
        background 0.18s ease;
    }

    .cta-tool:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      border-color: rgba(157, 222, 255, 0.9);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14),
        0 0 0 4px rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.14),
        0 22px 42px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(183, 229, 255, 0.18), transparent 32%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.5), rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.24)),
        rgba(22, 40, 54, 1);
    }

    .cta-tool__eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(224, 241, 251, 0.8);
    }

    .cta-tool__label {
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3.2vw, 1.9rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .cta-tool__meta {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: rgba(230, 242, 250, 0.86);
    }

    .home-secondary-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .secondary-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: rgba(240, 247, 251, 0.96);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
      transition:
        transform 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        background 0.18s ease;
    }

    .secondary-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      border-color: rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.38);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.065);
    }

    .hero-panel-card {
      height: 100%;
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025)),
        rgba(15, 23, 32, 0.8);
    }

    .hero-panel-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.36);
      background: rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.16);
      color: rgba(232, 246, 254, 0.95);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-panel-card h2,
    .home-section-head h2,
    .home-highlight h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.6vw, 2.35rem);
      line-height: 1.06;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .hero-panel-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      color: rgba(223, 232, 238, 0.86);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .hero-panel-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      width: fit-content;
      border-radius: 14px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #eef9ff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.54);
      background: rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.18);
    }

    .home-section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .home-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .home-grid--four {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .home-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)),
        rgba(11, 18, 27, 0.86);
      transition:
        transform 0.18s ease,
        border-color 0.18s ease,
        box-shadow 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.34);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    }

    .home-card--tool {
      border-color: rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.36);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%, rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.1), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(111, 184, 214, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)),
        rgba(11, 18, 27, 0.9);
    }

    .home-card h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .home-card p,
    .highlight-point span {
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(218, 229, 237, 0.82);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .home-card-link {
      color: rgba(201, 233, 248, 0.96);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .home-highlight-points {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .highlight-point {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    }

    .highlight-point strong {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgba(245, 249, 252, 0.98);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .home-hero-grid,
      .home-highlight-grid,
      .home-grid--four {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .home-hero-grid,
      .home-highlight-grid,
      .home-grid--four {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .home-hero-grid,
      .home-highlight-grid {
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .home-hero-copy h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 12vw, 4rem);
      }

      .cta-tool {
        padding: 16px 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
